\begin{MintedVerbatim}[commandchars=\\\{\}]
usage: compare\PYGZus{}models.py [\PYGZhy{}h] [\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}version] [\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}ignore\PYGZhy{}nodes IGNORE\PYGZus{}NODES]
                         [\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}ignore\PYGZhy{}attributes IGNORE\PYGZus{}ATTRIBUTES]
                         [\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}ignore\PYGZhy{}relations IGNORE\PYGZus{}RELATIONS] [\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}show\PYGZhy{}nodes] [\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}show\PYGZhy{}relations]
                         [\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}show\PYGZhy{}attributes] [\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}check\PYGZhy{}attribute\PYGZhy{}content] [\PYGZhy{}l \PYGZob{}INFO,DEBUG,ERROR\PYGZcb{}]
                         file1 file2

Compare two networkx graphs with ISMI data.

positional arguments:
  file1                 First networkx graph in gpickle format
  file2                 Second networkx graph in gpickle format

options:
  \PYGZhy{}h, \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}help            show this help message and exit
  \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}version             show program\PYGZsq{}s version number and exit
  \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}ignore\PYGZhy{}nodes IGNORE\PYGZus{}NODES
                        list of node types to ignore (comma\PYGZhy{}separated)
  \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}ignore\PYGZhy{}attributes IGNORE\PYGZus{}ATTRIBUTES
                        list of attributes to ignore on all entities (comma\PYGZhy{}separated)
  \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}ignore\PYGZhy{}relations IGNORE\PYGZus{}RELATIONS
                        list of relations to ignore on all entities (comma\PYGZhy{}separated)
  \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}show\PYGZhy{}nodes          show node differences in detail
  \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}show\PYGZhy{}relations      show relation differences in detail
  \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}show\PYGZhy{}attributes     show attribute differences in detail
  \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}check\PYGZhy{}attribute\PYGZhy{}content
                        check attribute content (optional)
\end{MintedVerbatim}
